        "Content": "Property Partners OBrien Swaine are delighted to present this exceptional 5-bedroom detached family home, occupying a superb private site in the highly sought-after Tara Hill area of County Wexford. Finished to a highly impressive standard throughout, this substantial residence offers generous living accommodation, beautifully maintained grounds and a wonderful balance of space, comfort and privacy. Tubberduff boasts an amazing views with all-day sunlight in one of the best settings in the area. This superior residential property, extending to circa 3103 Sq.Ft of spacious light-filled rooms represents an opportunity to acquire a truly magnificent home in an idyllic setting.\n\nSet amidst the picturesque surroundings of Tara Hill, this impressive home boasts five spacious bedrooms, two ensuite bathrooms, a walk-in wardrobe, a converted attic and a detached garage. The property has been thoughtfully designed with family living in mind and features high-quality finishes throughout, including a superb fitted kitchen and stylish bathroom suites.\n\nThe accommodation extends to a bright and welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a large kitchen/dining area, utility room, guest WC, home office, family room, four double bedrooms, two ensuite bathrooms, a family bathroom and a converted attic offering excellent additional space.\n\nTara Hill is one of Wexford?s most desirable residential locations, renowned for its scenic beauty, peaceful setting and close proximity to a host of local amenities. The area offers easy access to Gorey Town, beautiful beaches, woodland walks and excellent transport links, making it an ideal location for families seeking a country lifestyle without compromising on convenience.\n\nThis outstanding home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family residence in one of North Wexford?s most sought-after locations and must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nEntrance Hall: Tiled floor, radiator cover.\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace, double doors to :\n\nKitchen/Dining Room: Modern fully fitted kitchen with a good range of wall and floor units, tiled floor, quartz worktop.\n\nUtility Room: Shelving and storage, plumbed washing machine. \n\nGuest W.C., Wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1: Wooden flooring and T.V point.\n\nSitting Room: Wooden flooring, Solid fuel fire place. T.V. point.\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet. Walk in wardrobe. \n\nEn Suite: Wash hand basin, step in shower, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 3: Built in Wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite: Wash hand basin, step in shower fully tiled. \n\nMain Bathroom: Wash hand basin, with step in shower fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 4: Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 5: Carpet, walk in Wardrobe.\n\nThis outstanding home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family residence in one of North Wexford?s most sought-after locations and must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\n\nFeatures:\nFinished to highest of standards throughout\nExceptional 5-bedroom detached family home\nPrime Tara Hill location\nTwo ensuite bathrooms\nWalk-in wardrobe \nConverted attic\nDetached garage\nBeautifully maintained mature gardens\nSpacious and versatile accommodation throughout\nUtility room and guest WC\nPrivate well and septic tank\nEarly viewing highly recommended\n\n\n"
      },
